# EdminBoost QA

Three-layer local QA harness (MAMP). Full guide: `tests/README.md`.

## Layout

```
bin/
  run-phpunit.sh          # MAMP PHP wrapper
  install-wp-tests.sh     # WP test suite bootstrap
  setup-qa-site.sh        # QA users + plugin symlink; copies edminboost-localhost.sample.php → edminboost-localhost.php when missing
  edminboost-localhost.sample.php  # local Pro loader template (gitignored copy at plugin root)
  build-zip-lib.sh        # shared rsync staging for release zips (excludes edminboost-localhost.php)
  build-wporg-zip.sh      # WordPress.org package (excludes includes/pro/, admin/{partials,js,css}/pro/, assets/, docs/)
  build-plugin-zip.sh     # alias → build-wporg-zip.sh (back-compat)
  build-premium-zip.sh    # Premium/Freemius package
  verify-wporg-zip.sh     # fail if Freemius, includes/pro/, admin/{partials,js,css}/pro/, assets/, docs/, .cursor/, stray *.md, wp_org_gatekeeper, bare is_premium (allows is_premium_build identifiers), or premium billing symbols (EDMINBOOST_Billing, edminboost-billing-page.php, EDMINBOOST_UPGRADE_URL, edminboost_upgrade_url)
  verify-premium-zip.sh   # premium zip sanity checks (docs/, .cursor/, product *.md omitted; Freemius SDK README allowed; edminboost-localhost.php excluded at rsync — not asserted here)
  make-pot.sh             # regenerate languages/edminboost-admin-customization.pot (composer make-pot)
  generate-plugin-banners.py / generate-plugin-icons.py / generate-website-heroes.py  # marketing assets (heroes → assets/heroes/, optional in repo)
  capture-doc-screenshots.mjs  # optional docs screenshots (Playwright)
  capture-wporg-screenshots.mjs  # WordPress.org readme screenshots → assets/screenshot-{1..15}.png (free-tier UI; temporarily renames edminboost-localhost.php)
  seed-wporg-screenshot-demo.php  # WP-CLI eval-file seed for capture script (wizard + demo modes via EDMINBOOST_SCREENSHOT_SEED)
tests/
  bootstrap.php           # PHPUnit bootstrap
  wp-tests-config.php     # local DB config (gitignored; copy from .sample)
  phpunit/                # *Test.php classes
  e2e/
    playwright.config.ts
    fixtures/             # pages.ts, helpers.ts
    specs/                # *.spec.ts
  manual/
    regression-matrix.md  # post-automation checklist
    issue-template.md
.env.qa.example           # copy to .env.qa (gitignored)
phpunit.xml.dist
composer.json             # composer test
package.json              # npm run test:e2e
```

## Commands

```bash
composer install && npm install
cp .env.qa.example .env.qa
cp tests/wp-tests-config.sample.php tests/wp-tests-config.php
bash bin/setup-qa-site.sh   # one-time (creates edminboost-localhost.php for full Pro UI in browser)

composer test               # PHPUnit (uses MAMP PHP via bin/run-phpunit.sh; EDMINBOOST_DISABLE_LOCALHOST — no localhost Pro shim)
EDMINBOOST_TEST_WPORG=1 composer test   # simulate WP.org build (skip loading includes/pro/edminboost-premium.php)
npm run test:e2e            # Playwright (PLAYWRIGHT_BROWSERS_PATH=./.playwright-browsers)
npm run test:e2e:ui         # debug UI
npm run test:e2e:report     # open HTML report

# WordPress.org plugin screenshots (requires .env.qa, bin/wp-cli.phar from setup-qa-site.sh)
node bin/capture-wporg-screenshots.mjs   # writes assets/screenshot-*.png; disables localhost Pro shim during capture
```

PHPUnit uses table prefix `wptests_` in the `wordpress` database (separate from live tables). E2E reads `.env.qa` (`BASE_URL`, `ADMIN_USER`, `ADMIN_PASSWORD`, `EDITOR_USER`, `EDITOR_PASSWORD`, `PLUGIN_SLUG`). `PLUGIN_SLUG` must match `EDMINBOOST_PLUGIN_SLUG` / bootstrap filename (`edminboost-admin-customization`).

## PHPUnit Patterns

- Extend `Edminboost_Test_Case` (resets options, resets CC static caches, seeds admin user, calls `EDMINBOOST_Command_Center::ensure_discovery_menu_snapshot()`; `enable_pro_plan()` sets `edminboost_is_pro_active` for Pro-only behavior tests).
- Use `seed_settings( $overrides )` — merges with `EDMINBOOST_Settings::get_defaults()`.
- Test files: `tests/phpunit/{Settings,Features,CommandCenter,CommandCenterBar,Theme,AdminMenuOrder,Pro}Test.php`.
- Name tests `test_{behavior}`; target static helpers on bar/CC classes where hook tests are heavy.
- `SettingsTest::test_plugin_slug_and_text_domain_match_header()` asserts `EDMINBOOST_PLUGIN_SLUG`, `EDMINBOOST_TEXT_DOMAIN`, and bootstrap filename match the plugin header / slug (`edminboost-admin-customization`).
- Pro gating tests: `ProTest` (`include_preset_in_ui`, `EDMINBOOST_Pro::has_licensed_admin_ui`, `EDMINBOOST_Plan_Limits::enforce_plan_limits`, `test_strip_free_build_product_features_on_get` / `_on_sanitize` when `! is_direct_build()` — run with `EDMINBOOST_TEST_WPORG=1` in dev tree); billing catalog in `CommandCenterTest` uses `EDMINBOOST_Billing::*` when the premium package is loaded; `CommandCenterTest::test_get_page_links` / `test_get_nav_items` always include `PAGE_BILLING`; `AdminMenuOrderTest` expects Billing in sidebar labels (registers `EDMINBOOST_Admin_Billing` when premium package loaded). Use `enable_pro_plan()` in tests that need drawer/badge, role visibility sanitization, or Pro-saved options.

## Playwright Patterns

- Auth: `global.setup.ts` saves `tests/e2e/.auth/admin.json` (gitignored).
- Page URLs: `fixtures/pages.ts` — built from `PLUGIN_SLUG` env var (`dashboard`, `appearance`, `billing`, `settings`, `mapper`, `presets`, `productivity`, `security`, `performance`, `white-label`; legacy `onboarding` / `behavior` for redirect tests).
- Assert plugin ready: `.edminboost-wrap[data-edminboost-ready="true"]`.
- Settings saves: `waitForSettingsSaved()` in `fixtures/helpers.ts` (URL contains `settings-updated=true`).
- Specs mirror admin pages: `dashboard` (overview pickers + inline save), `home-setup` (setup wizard / overview), `home-look` (Theme/declutter on Appearance — theme extras live preview `#edminboost-theme-extras-preview-viewport` font size + status row colors; declutter preview at `#edminboost-declutter-preview`; panel/badge/drawer-width tests should target Top Bar / `pages.mapper`), `settings-features` (Productivity feature toggles), `layout-studio`, `presets-roles`, `live-admin-bar`.
- Config: single worker, 60s timeout, chromium only, `baseURL` from `.env.qa`.

## Rules

- Never commit `.env.qa`, `tests/wp-tests-config.php`, `edminboost-localhost.php`, `tests/e2e/.auth/`, `vendor/`, `node_modules/`, `playwright-report/`, `test-results/`, `.playwright-browsers/`, `.phpunit.result.cache`.
- E2E selectors: prefer stable plugin IDs/classes (`#edminboost-*`, `.edminboost-*`) over wp-admin internals.
- Add PHPUnit for new sanitization/helpers (e.g. `CommandCenterTest::test_get_page_links`, `test_get_nav_items`, `test_get_billing_plans`, `test_get_billing_comparison_rows`, `test_get_upgrade_url` (includes `edminboost_upgrade_url` filter), `test_sanitize_setup_wizard_save_virtual_default`, `test_get_role_system_presets`, `test_normalize_dashicon_class`, `test_detect_active_layout_preset`, `test_get_picker_presets`, `test_top_bar_items_match`, `test_sanitize_apply_preset_replaces_custom_menu_studio`, `test_get_role_matrix_menu_items_includes_submenus`, `test_role_visibility_sanitization`, `test_apply_role_visibility_hides_submenu_items`; `CommandCenterBarTest::test_get_items_for_current_user_role_visibility`, `test_get_items_for_current_user_respects_saved_role_visibility_override`; `SettingsTest::test_sanitize_dashboard_theme_preset_clears_stale_custom_flag`, `test_sanitize_dashboard_overview_payload_without_features`, `test_sanitize_save_custom_preset_with_name`, `test_sanitize_rename_custom_preset`; `ThemeTest` for preset catalog, custom colors, body classes, theme extras sanitize; `FeaturesTest::test_menu_studio_protected_slugs`, `test_resolve_menu_studio_for_user_preserves_custom_items`, `test_menu_studio_registers_custom_sidebar_links`, `test_menu_studio_use_colors_off_resets_colors_on_save`; `CommandCenterTest::test_get_animation_speed_options` for drawer duration helpers); add Playwright for new admin UI flows (CC tab nav, dashboard overview pickers + live theme preview, billing page plan cards + comparison table `.edminboost-billing-comparison`, Appearance declutter preview `#edminboost-declutter-preview`, theme extras preview `#edminboost-theme-extras-preview`, Top Bar panel/badge controls `#edminboost-mapper-look`, Menu Studio layout/color live previews, Layout Presets role matrix submenu columns `.edminboost-role-matrix__menu-col.is-submenu`, form reset confirm + reload, White Label status preview `#edminboost-wl-status-preview`, Settings export/import `#edminboost-backup-section`, setup wizard step 1 Default preset in layout picker); update `tests/manual/regression-matrix.md` for manual-only checks (e.g. CC-B-02 animation speed).
- Run `composer test` and `npm run test:e2e` before shipping user-facing CC or settings changes.
